Package: cancerCohortWgcnaSurvival
Title: Reproducible Cancer Cohort Differential Expression, WGCNA, GSEA, and Survival Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Config-driven R/Bioconductor workflow for bulk cancer transcriptomics
    combining limma differential expression, WGCNA co-expression modules, fgsea
    pathway enrichment, and Cox/Kaplan-Meier overall survival modeling on TCGA-CESC.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    data.table,
    dplyr,
    fgsea,
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite,
    limma,
    patchwork,
    survival,
    tidyr,
    WGCNA,
    yaml
Suggests:
    testthat
biocViews: DifferentialExpression, GeneExpression, Survival, NetworkInference
